  m_text: "We value your privacy\n\nTo show ads that keep this game free, we and
    our partners may collect device identifiers and usage data to personalize ads.\n\nYou
    can choose whether to allow personalized ads:\n\n- <b>If you accept, ads may
    be tailored to your interests.</b>\n- <b>If you decline, you\u2019ll still see
    ads, but they won\u2019t be personalized.</b>\n\nYou can change your choice anytime
    in the app\u2019s settings."
